# 强制文本文件使用 LF 行尾，避免 Windows (CRLF) 与 CI (Linux/LF) 的
# dart format 结果不一致，导致 CI 反复报格式错误。
# Force LF for text files so `dart format` yields identical results on
# Windows (CRLF) and CI (Linux/LF), preventing repeated format failures.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.dart text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.gradle text eol=lf
*.kt text eol=lf
*.swift text eol=lf
*.podspec text eol=lf

# 二进制文件不转换 / binary files are left untouched
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.svg text eol=lf
